{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261029/photo/bkn-20261029211753568-1029_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261029225151\"/><p>不適女住戶接受治理。（余宏基攝）</p><p>今晚(29日)8時27分，油麻地新填地街190號後樓梯起火，火勢蔓到平台及冒出濃煙，街坊發現報案。消防趕至開喉迅速把火救熄，經初步調查，相信後樓梯有雜物起火後，火舌再焫平台的雜物，起火原因待查。事件中，一名女住戶疑吸入濃煙不適，在現場接受治理後，毋須送院。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:23:04.882394+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T13:17:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T15:18:26.926380+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:18:26.926380+00:00","content_hash":"e7966a1ca1ec8d297c0ffc7631b98ac4ee816a4736d7711dc175e2c9dbc6e31f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}